      "text": "(720 ILCS 5/32-3) (from Ch. 38, par. 32-3)"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Sec. 32-3. Subornation of perjury."
    },
    {
      "type": "subsection",
      "label": "(a)",
      "text": "(a) A person commits subornation of perjury when he or she knowingly procures or induces another to make a statement in violation of Section 32-2 which the person knows to be false."
    },
    {
      "type": "subsection",
      "label": "(b)",
      "text": "(b) Sentence."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Subornation of perjury is a Class 4 felony."
    },
    {
      "type": "source",
      "text": "(Source: P.A. 97-1108, eff. 1-1-13.)"
    }
  ],
